<title>PHILIPPINES: PNB sets a 37.5 pct stock dividend.</title>
<headline>PNB sets a 37.5 pct stock dividend.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-10-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Philippine National Bank announced a 37.5 percent stock dividend, the Philippine Stock Exchange said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The record date has yet to be set since the Central Bank of the Philippines still has to approve the dividend declaration.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom 63 2 8418938 Fax 8176267</p>
</text>
